# Title: CreateDump Process Dump
# ID: 515c8be5-e5df-4c5e-8f6d-a4a2f05e4b48
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-01-04
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, attack.credential-access
# Description: Detects uses of the createdump.exe LOLOBIN utility to dump process memory
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine contains " -u " OR CommandLine contains " --full " OR CommandLine contains " -f " OR CommandLine contains " --name " OR CommandLine contains ".dmp ")) AND ((Image="*\\createdump.exe") OR (OriginalFileName equals "FX_VER_INTERNALNAME_STR")))
